Subject: [PATCH] Results page: remove small fleet map from normal view; table
 becomes primary fleet overview

- Small FleetOceanMap (and its legend) no longer rendered on the normal
  Results page; the fleet table now fills the full width and vertical
  space of the left Fleet section.
- Real interactive world map (markers, trajectories, controls, legend)
  is preserved exactly, accessible only via the existing Expand Fleet /
  Full Screen view.
- No changes to backend, decoder, batch logic, run history, map data
  logic, dynamic float discovery, table data, or any hardcoded values.
---
